WEBVTT

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:02.980
Yuya...

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:08.190
I acknowledge that you have drawn out 
the four dragons' power to its fullest.

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:14.690
But even that power is nothing before 
the ultimate portfolio I have arranged. {D: TC - slightly different than the line in last ep. Not sure if it's supposed to match}

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:16.980
What's a portfolio?

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:18.400
I don't know,

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:22.400
but it likely refers to a combo those 
three Doom Kings produce.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:27.930
The effect of D/D/D Super Doom 
King Bright Armageddon

00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:32.740
forces you to choose one Pendulum 
Monster from your field!

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:36.450
But the only Pendulum 
Monster on my field is...

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:40.140
Yes. Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon.

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:42.940
Thus, Bright Armageddon's effect

00:00:42.940 --> 00:00:46.490
negates the effect of all your other dragons!

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:55.670
And I activate the effect of Dark Armageddon!

00:00:55.670 --> 00:01:00.810
I use one Overlay Unit to destroy as many 
non-Pendulum Monsters on your field

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:04.800
as there are Pendulum Monsters on my field!

00:01:06.450 --> 00:01:07.840
Dark Rebellion!

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:09.000
Clear Wing!

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.180
Starving Venom!

00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:12.880
Then Purple Armageddon's effect

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:15.790
destroys the remaining 
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon,

00:01:15.790 --> 00:01:19.690
dealing its attack points as damage to you!

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:25.260
Yuya!

00:01:29.460 --> 00:01:31.870
I now end my turn.

00:01:31.870 --> 00:01:33.500
Well, Yuya...

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:38.340
Now that you have lost all your dragons, 
how do you intend to make me smile?

00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:41.910
Well, I don't know...

00:01:42.520 --> 00:01:44.260
But I have decided.

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:47.120
I will make everyone smile!

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:49.320
Both you... and Layra.

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:52.820
I will make Layra smile and save the world.

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:56.560
And I'll bring Yuzu back... no matter what!

00:01:58.070 --> 00:02:00.490
So lend me your power, once more.

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:03.940
Joeri. Hugo. Ute.

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:08.040
Our power already belongs to you.

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:10.540
We were one person to start with, after all!

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:13.260
Do all you can, Yuya.

00:02:13.260 --> 00:02:16.520
If you have fun, I know you can help 
everyone else to have fun, too.

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:20.020
That's right.

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:23.820
If I want to make Z-ARC 
smile, I have to, as well!

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:33.000
The Miracle Drawn by the Pendulum

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:36.560
I'll bring everyone's feelings together!

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:37.990
My turn!

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:42.410
There it is.

00:02:42.410 --> 00:02:45.280
Now, a new gate has opened!

00:02:45.280 --> 00:02:46.650
Go, Yuya...

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:49.780
This is the answer we've found!

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:52.950
Quick-Play Spell Odd-Eyes Fusiongate!

00:02:53.240 --> 00:02:56.140
I Special Summon Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon

00:02:56.140 --> 00:02:58.830
from my Extra Deck, and Starving 
Venom Fusion Dragon

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:01.770
from my graveyard, 
with their effects negated.

00:03:01.770 --> 00:03:04.330
Then I use those two as components 
to Fusion Summon!

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:06.670
Fusing two dragons?

00:03:07.130 --> 00:03:08.630
Dragon with different-colored eyes...

00:03:08.990 --> 00:03:11.200
...become one with the poison dragon.

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:13.910
And become the power that 
walks the path of conquest!

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:16.110
Fusion Summon!

00:03:16.110 --> 00:03:17.240
Appear...

00:03:17.270 --> 00:03:20.550
Level 10!  The dragon with glass 
eyes, sparkling with love,

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:23.770
Odd-Eyes Venom Dragon!

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:29.210
How pure...

00:03:29.210 --> 00:03:31.690
Joeri's dragon has been purified?

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:35.390
I activate Odd-Eyes Venom Dragon's effect!

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:40.570
Until the End Phase, I increase its 
attack points by the sum total

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:42.530
of all monsters on your field!

00:03:47.010 --> 00:03:50.000
13,800 attack points?!

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.980
It's like a flower blooming!

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:57.980
Battle! Odd-Eyes Venom Dragon 
attacks Bright Doom Armageddon!

00:03:58.450 --> 00:04:00.850
Power alone won't help you surpass me.

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:03.420
Purple Doom Armageddon's effect...

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:08.140
Once per turn, until damage calculation, 
I can restore the attack points

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:11.450
of a monster doing battle with one 
of mine, to their original points.

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:14.270
It's back to normal!

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:16.780
He's fighting a monster with 
3500 attack points...

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:18.370
Oh, no! He's gonna lose!

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:25.240
Wonder Chance... This will...

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:33.770
Still more to go.

00:04:33.770 --> 00:04:36.120
Go, Yuya!

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:38.400
When a monster fused by Odd-Eyes Fusiongate

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:43.060
is destroyed, I can send this card to the graveyard,

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:47.470
and add Quick-Play Spell Odd-Eyes 
Synchrogate to my hand from my deck.

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:49.430
Synchrogate?

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:51.280
Then, I activate it!

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:54.380
I Special Summon Odd-Eyes Pendulum 
Dragon from my Extra Deck,

00:04:54.380 --> 00:04:59.480
and Clear-Wing Synchro Dragon from my 
graveyard, with monster effects negated!

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:05.380
Then, I treat Odd-Eyes as a Level 1 
Tuner Monster, to tune Clear Wing!

00:05:06.290 --> 00:05:07.850
Dragon with different-colored eyes...

00:05:08.350 --> 00:05:10.090
...gain shining wings.

00:05:10.090 --> 00:05:12.550
And fly to the path of conquest's summit!

00:05:13.320 --> 00:05:14.760
Synchro Summon!

00:05:15.180 --> 00:05:17.290
Come out, Level 8...

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:20.500
The dragon with joyous eyes, 
shining with furious destruction.

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:22.940
Odd-Eyes Wing Dragon!

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:29.910
I feel it, Yuya. The excitement of your life.

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:32.220
This is your way of dueling!

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:34.710
Then, follow that path, without hesitation!

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:38.650
I activate Odd-Eyes Wing Dragon's effect!

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:43.210
Once per turn, I destroy all monsters 
on your side of the field,

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:47.290
and add their attack points to those 
of Odd-Eyes Wing dragon!

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:49.660
Destroying all of Reiji's monsters at once?

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:51.760
Wing Dragon is so strong!

00:05:55.890 --> 00:05:59.850
As long as Dark Armageddon is on my field,

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:02.910
my Pendulum Monsters cannot 
be destroyed by effects!

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:08.650
In that case, I'll attack Dark Armageddon 
with Odd-Eyes Wing Dragon.

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:12.160
But his opponent's attack points are higher!

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:13.620
No, that's...

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:26.600
It was intentional!

00:06:26.600 --> 00:06:30.570
Yes. By having his Fusion 
Monster destroyed earlier,

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:33.140
he was able to get to the Synchrogate 
card in his hand.

00:06:33.140 --> 00:06:34.750
This time, from Synchro...

00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:35.980
...to Xyz?

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:38.300
Go for it!

00:06:38.300 --> 00:06:40.310
Yeah, we leave it to you.

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:43.130
The effect of Odd-Eyes Synchrogate, 
on my field, is that

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:46.550
when a monster Synchro Summoned 
through its effect is destroyed...

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:48.120
By sending it to the graveyard,

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:52.410
I can add Quick-Play Spell 
Odd-Eyes Xyzgate to my hand!

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:54.090
Then I activate it!

00:06:54.090 --> 00:06:57.070
I Special Summon Odd-Eyes Pendulum
 Dragon from my Extra Deck,

00:06:57.070 --> 00:07:02.140
and Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon from my graveyard, 
with both cards' effects negated,

00:07:02.140 --> 00:07:04.620
and change Dark Rebellion to Level 7.

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:08.470
Then I overlay Odd-Eyes and Dark Rebellion!

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:13.550
Dragon with different-colored eyes...

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:16.190
...let your black anger tremble.

00:07:16.190 --> 00:07:18.450
And exterminate all who stand against you!

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:20.150
Xyz Summon!

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:22.490
Come out, Rank 7...

00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:28.160
Let your eyes shine with anger, 
Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon!

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:29.870
It's a chain...

00:07:29.870 --> 00:07:31.100
From fusion...

00:07:31.100 --> 00:07:32.070
...to Synchro.

00:07:32.070 --> 00:07:32.960
And then...

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:34.130
...Xyz!

00:07:34.570 --> 00:07:38.340
And then, I use the effect of 
Odd-Eyes Xyzgate to banish it,

00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:42.810
Fusiongate, and Synchrogate in my 
graveyard, to activate their effects!

00:07:43.260 --> 00:07:48.940
This increases Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon's 
attack points by 1000, during my Battle Phase,

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:50.780
and allows it to attack twice.

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:54.320
I also use my Action Spell Wonder Chance

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:57.760
to allow Odd-Eyes Rebellion 
Dragon to attack once more!

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:01.000
That's the Action Card from before!

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:04.930
Now he can attack all three 
of Reiji Akaba's monsters!

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:08.530
He can't destroy them with card 
effects, but with battle...

00:08:08.530 --> 00:08:10.900
Okay! Get him, Yuya!

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:12.140
Battle!

00:08:12.140 --> 00:08:19.740
Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon attacks Purple, 
Bright, and Dark Armageddons!

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:26.540
Lightning of Revolution... Strike!

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:38.330
Wow...

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:41.640
Did he finish them?

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:43.400
I can't tell with all that smoke.

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:46.120
That's...

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:47.370
It can't be...

00:08:56.610 --> 00:08:58.410
Too bad.

00:08:58.410 --> 00:09:02.730
As long as Purple Armageddon is on my field,

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:06.420
my Pendulum Monsters can't be 
destroyed by battle, either.

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:08.760
Are you kidding?

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:15.930
When battle ends, Odd-Eyes 
Xyzgate's effect ends, too.

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:19.140
Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon's 
attack points return to normal.

00:09:20.520 --> 00:09:24.010
I set one card and end my turn.

00:09:24.010 --> 00:09:26.190
Yuya has no cards in his hand.

00:09:26.190 --> 00:09:29.690
His dragons won't last through the next turn.

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:31.720
He'll have to bet on that set card!

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:34.520
If you cannot make Layra smile,

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:40.390
we will have to live with the time bomb 
of the devil's future resurrection.

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:45.360
Please, Yuya! Yuzu... Save Yuzu!

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:47.180
My turn!

00:09:48.140 --> 00:09:51.000
I activate Purple Armageddon's effect

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:56.040
to destroy your dragon and deal its 
3000 attack points as damage to you!

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:02.570
I activate my trap Abysmal Entertainment!

00:10:02.570 --> 00:10:04.670
When a Pendulum Monster is destroyed,

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:08.590
for this turn, I render all effect and 
battle damage I'm dealt to 0,

00:10:08.590 --> 00:10:12.390
and set that Pendulum Monster 
in my Pendulum Zone!

00:10:13.560 --> 00:10:15.550
The real show is just getting started.

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:18.000
I'm gonna show you my last entertainment!

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:20.200
Yuya!

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:23.960
Show it to me, then... Your entertainment!

00:10:23.960 --> 00:10:26.170
I now end my turn.

00:10:26.510 --> 00:10:28.910
Let's go! My turn!

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:32.640
I activate Odd-Eyes Rebellion 
Dragon's Pendulum Effect!

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:37.120
I can set one Pendulum Monster in 
my deck to my Pendulum Zone.

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:42.090
I choose Scale 12 Performapal 
Five-Rainbow Magician!

00:10:49.090 --> 00:10:50.880
So that's his plan!

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:54.800
Now he can summon monsters between 
Levels 5 and 11 simultaneously!

00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:57.770
Swing, my soul's pendulum.

00:10:58.200 --> 00:11:00.740
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:11:00.740 --> 00:11:02.570
Pendulum Summon!

00:11:02.570 --> 00:11:04.890
Be reborn from my Extra Deck!

00:11:08.130 --> 00:11:11.550
Odd-Eyes Venom Dragon,

00:11:12.240 --> 00:11:15.470
Odd-Eyes Wing Dragon,

00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:19.220
Performapal Odd-Eyes Seer,

00:11:20.050 --> 00:11:22.430
Performapal Ignition Eagle!

00:11:22.430 --> 00:11:28.510
In that instant, Bright Armageddon's effect 
is reset, and I activate it again.

00:11:28.510 --> 00:11:31.400
I force you to select one of 
your Pendulum Monsters,

00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:34.980
and all other monsters have their effect negated!

00:11:35.410 --> 00:11:38.380
I select Odd-Eyes Seer.

00:11:38.700 --> 00:11:40.240
And I activate its effect!

00:11:40.680 --> 00:11:42.480
By banishing itself,

00:11:42.810 --> 00:11:46.490
I can Special Summon Odd-Eyes 
Pendulum Dragon from my graveyard!

00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:55.690
Every time you summon a monster, 
I activate Bright's effect.

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:56.830
Now, choose!

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:01.500
I choose Ignition Eagle!

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:02.130
And then...

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:08.310
I activate Five-Rainbow Magician's 
Pendulum Effect!

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:27.880
What? He reduced all of the 
monsters' attack points to 0?

00:12:31.990 --> 00:12:33.500
Not just his opponent's monsters,

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:36.470
but even his own monsters' 
attack points are down to 0?

00:12:36.840 --> 00:12:39.070
How does he intend to fight like that?

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:42.080
But Yuya's still smiling.

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:47.340
Yeah... Like a child who's 
about to have a ton of fun!

00:12:48.010 --> 00:12:52.250
The field is now under the influence 
of Five-Rainbow Magician's effect.

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:57.770
If four or fewer cards are set in either 
of our Spell and Trap Zones,

00:12:57.770 --> 00:13:00.890
your attack points are reduced 
to 0, you can't battle,

00:13:00.890 --> 00:13:03.580
and no monsters on your field can use effects.

00:13:03.580 --> 00:13:06.190
But the moment you set a fifth card,

00:13:06.190 --> 00:13:11.170
that restriction is lifted, and all of your 
monsters' attack points are doubled!

00:13:11.480 --> 00:13:13.140
I set my first card!

00:13:14.050 --> 00:13:18.610
When I set one card, Five-Rainbow 
Magician's effect ends my turn.

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:22.360
In addition, players can set 
cards acquired in any phase

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:23.870
other than their Draw Phase.

00:13:23.870 --> 00:13:24.910
I see.

00:13:24.910 --> 00:13:28.950
Whoever sets five cards first will 
earn the privilege of victory, then.

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:30.160
Yeah.

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:33.420
They won't have to end their turn, 
and they can also attack.

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:34.890
Very well.

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:35.890
I accept your challenge!

00:13:35.890 --> 00:13:38.800
Hold on! Be careful with your draw.

00:13:38.800 --> 00:13:42.860
On turns when you draw, you can't 
set spell and trap cards.

00:13:42.860 --> 00:13:43.630
Which means...

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:44.870
My turn!

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:48.340
Using the effect of Five-Rainbow 
Magician, I skip my draw.

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:49.810
That's the way!

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:00.920
I set my first card.

00:14:00.920 --> 00:14:02.250
I now end my turn!

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:04.110
That's the Reiji I know.

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:06.720
He's grasped the rules and 
he's using his monsters.

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:09.390
Okay... in that case!

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:15.330
My turn...

00:14:15.650 --> 00:14:17.540
I set my second card!

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:21.010
Five-Rainbow Magician's effect ends my turn!

00:14:21.010 --> 00:14:22.340
My turn!

00:14:23.110 --> 00:14:25.810
I set my third card and end my turn!

00:14:25.810 --> 00:14:29.770
Reiji's beating Yuya at his own game.

00:14:29.770 --> 00:14:33.780
He's usually so cool, but he's flying 
and jumping with his monsters!

00:14:33.780 --> 00:14:36.040
A true action duel.

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:40.490
Yuya's forced Reiji to compete in his own specialty.

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:44.510
Yuya's entertainment has begun, then.

00:14:44.510 --> 00:14:46.360
He's bringing not just Reiji into it,

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:49.700
but the monsters, the audience, and everyone.

00:14:52.760 --> 00:14:53.820
My turn!

00:14:54.640 --> 00:14:56.570
I set my second card!

00:15:03.010 --> 00:15:04.700
Now it's three to two.

00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:06.980
Okay, keep it up

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:08.450
My turn!

00:15:12.840 --> 00:15:13.860
Third one!

00:15:14.190 --> 00:15:15.950
Yuya got two in a row!

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:18.230
Yeah! Now it's even!

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:19.860
My turn!

00:15:28.630 --> 00:15:32.760
This waveform... It's reacting to something.

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:41.220
My fourth!

00:15:41.530 --> 00:15:43.450
Reiji's set his fourth card!

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:45.590
Oh, no! He's almost reached it!

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:47.430
My turn!

00:15:49.890 --> 00:15:51.960
I set my fourth card, too!

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:55.670
I end my turn, under Five-Rainbow 
Magician's effect.

00:15:55.670 --> 00:15:57.390
The next one will decide it.

00:15:57.390 --> 00:15:58.370
Yeah.

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:04.210
It's clearly reacting!

00:16:04.820 --> 00:16:07.080
The pulse is getting faster...

00:16:23.470 --> 00:16:24.530
My turn!

00:16:24.530 --> 00:16:25.730
I...

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:29.130
Which one?

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:30.400
Which one will do it first?

00:16:32.900 --> 00:16:34.010
It's Yuya!

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:40.680
Now, under Five-Rainbow Magician's 
effect, you can't set any more cards.

00:16:40.960 --> 00:16:46.150
And the attack points of all monsters 
on my field are doubled!

00:16:46.720 --> 00:16:52.620
Battle! I attack Bright Armageddon 
with Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:16:53.050 --> 00:16:55.590
Yes! Now, Yuya wins!

00:16:55.590 --> 00:16:56.830
Not so fast!

00:16:57.560 --> 00:17:00.890
I activate the effect of D/D Savant 
Einstein in my hand!

00:17:00.890 --> 00:17:02.570
When your monster attacks,

00:17:02.860 --> 00:17:07.680
I can send this card to my graveyard, 
to set one spell card from my hand.

00:17:08.450 --> 00:17:10.270
Now, I have five, as well.

00:17:10.270 --> 00:17:14.380
In that instant, the attack points 
of all my monsters double, too!

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:15.530
Not good!

00:17:15.530 --> 00:17:17.620
5000 against 7000... He'll lose!

00:17:17.950 --> 00:17:21.260
I activate Performapal 
Ignition Eagle's effect!

00:17:22.230 --> 00:17:27.200
I Special Summon Odd-Eyes Rebellion 
Dragon from my Pendulum Zone

00:17:27.200 --> 00:17:29.700
and set this card in its place!

00:17:31.410 --> 00:17:33.930
And I add Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon's attack points

00:17:33.930 --> 00:17:36.830
to the Odd-Eyes that has declared battle!

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:42.240
I'm sure you haven't forgotten...

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:44.250
Each time you summon a monster,

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:48.710
Bright Armageddon's effect is 
reset and activated again!

00:17:49.980 --> 00:17:53.320
I select Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon,

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:55.660
and I negate the effects of all other monsters.

00:17:55.660 --> 00:17:56.950
Battle continues!

00:17:56.950 --> 00:18:01.960
It's no use! As long as Purple 
Armageddon is on the field,

00:18:01.960 --> 00:18:04.650
my Pendulum Monsters cannot 
be destroyed by battle.

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:09.130
And once per battle, I can return your 
monster's attack points to normal.

00:18:11.970 --> 00:18:13.740
Now, it's over!

00:18:13.740 --> 00:18:15.940
Go... Destroy yourself!

00:18:18.380 --> 00:18:21.110
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:22.810
What now?!

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:27.310
Everyone... My pal, Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon,

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:31.200
is about to become stronger, with the 
encouragement of his allies.

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:33.710
That's the power that brings 
the pendulum together...

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:35.290
The arc of light!

00:18:35.290 --> 00:18:37.030
Arc of light?

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:40.060
Now, watch carefully.

00:18:40.060 --> 00:18:42.870
I activate Ignition Eagle's Pendulum Effect!

00:18:43.280 --> 00:18:47.770
By banishing Ignition Eagle and Five-Rainbow 
Magician from my Pendulum Zone,

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:50.370
I can destroy all set cards on each side.

00:18:56.680 --> 00:19:03.080
Then, for each, I'll shoot one Performapal 
into the night sky, beautifully!

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:05.340
Count with me, everyone.

00:19:05.340 --> 00:19:06.400
Five!

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:07.260
Four!

00:19:07.260 --> 00:19:08.230
Three!

00:19:08.230 --> 00:19:09.190
Two!

00:19:09.190 --> 00:19:10.160
One!

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:11.360
Ignition!

00:19:36.450 --> 00:19:38.090
Time for the finale!

00:19:38.470 --> 00:19:41.290
For each Pendulum Monster on my field,

00:19:41.290 --> 00:19:43.760
Ignition Eagle's activated effect

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:47.270
adds 500 attack points to 
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon.

00:19:47.270 --> 00:19:49.560
In other words, 2000!

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:56.060
Now go, Odd-Eyes...

00:19:57.920 --> 00:20:00.740
Spiral Strike Burst!

00:20:01.330 --> 00:20:05.980
Purple Armageddon's effect prevents 
my monsters' destruction.

00:20:05.980 --> 00:20:08.450
Yes, but you still take damage.

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:10.920
And Odd-Eyes's effect doubles it!

00:20:11.510 --> 00:20:13.690
Reaction Force!

00:20:39.190 --> 00:20:40.880
Layra...

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:45.210
Layra is... smiling!

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:53.840
The winner, Yuya Sakaki.

00:20:53.840 --> 00:20:55.530
He passes his pro test!

00:22:27.010 --> 00:22:28.460
I knew it.

00:22:30.390 --> 00:22:31.260
I knew that you...

00:22:32.880 --> 00:22:36.800
...could make everyone smile 
with your duels, Yuya.

00:22:39.060 --> 00:22:41.270
Welcome back, Yuzu.

00:22:42.370 --> 00:22:44.710
Thanks, Yuya.

00:22:45.240 --> 00:22:46.990
Yuya!

00:22:45.720 --> 00:22:48.710
I got shivers!

00:22:51.180 --> 00:22:55.230
I'm sure that Z-ARC is smiling, 
right along with Layra.

00:22:55.650 --> 00:23:00.300
Yes... And the world is, 
once more, trying to unite,

00:23:00.300 --> 00:23:02.490
thanks to Yuya Sakaki's duel.

00:23:02.490 --> 00:23:04.460
Thanks to Yuya's duel?

00:23:11.430 --> 00:23:14.670
If you think it's all over, 
you're greatly mistaken!

00:23:15.110 --> 00:23:16.140
Dad!

00:23:16.140 --> 00:23:22.900
Yuya, your true battle began the 
moment you passed your test.

00:23:22.900 --> 00:23:26.380
Are you ready to keep fighting, as a pro?

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:27.720
Of course!

00:23:27.720 --> 00:23:30.960
I'm gonna keep using my duels 
to make people smile!

00:23:30.960 --> 00:23:35.140
And I'm gonna become an entertainment 
duelist to surpass you, Dad!

00:23:35.540 --> 00:23:38.250
The fun is only getting started!
